			"Message": "style(Echo): Normalize HTML formatting and self-closing tags in README\n\nRefactor README.md to use consistent indentation and line breaks for inline text in `<h3>` headers and `<th>` cells. Add self-closing slashes to void elements (`<source>`, `<img>`) and remove redundant `&#x2001;` em-spaces before emoji row markers.\n\nImproves HTML consistency and readability without changing rendered output.",
